            "detailed_description": "Jump into Super Island God and take on the role of a lost island tribe's deity in this exciting new God Simulator. Harness your divine power in this built-for-VR game and reward (or punish) your civilization as they journey through dozens of handcrafted challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in Virtual Reality and watch your villagers and environment respond in new and novel ways.  <br></li><li>Direct your villagers across six unique and challenging islands with hidden objectives and time attack modes. <br></li><li>Construct and grow your village using unique buildings and an expanding number of villager jobs.   <br></li><li>Wield your divine powers and cast miracles to reward (or punish) your villagers.  <br></li><li>Discover hidden toys and easter eggs such as the hungry volcano (feed me...)!<br></li><li>Unlock unique cosmetic hands by unearthing hidden coins.  </li></ul><br>Super Island God is a VR-Only game!",
